From what I've gathered throughout our exchange, the notion of allowing religious groups sole discretion over interpreting and thus defining laws brings forward questions regarding inclusivity and representation. A system built purely around divine dictates may overlook or marginalize certain perspectives critical in crafting inclusive policies reflective of all constituents

